ss": "Text", "height": 107, "width": 403, "position": {"column_min": 18, "row_min": 88, "column_max": 421, "row_max": 195}, "text_content": "In : earth the .\nAnd the earth was without form , and void\nand darkness was upon the face of the deep . And the\nSpirit of God moved upon the face of the waters .\nbeginning God created the heaven and the", "children": [4, 5]}, {"id": 24, "class": "Text", "height": 15, "width": 388, "position": {"column_min": 32, "row_min": 210, "column_max": 420, "row_max": 225}, "text_content": "And God said , Let there be light : and there was light ."}, {"id": 25, "class": "Text", "height": 88, "width": 385, "position": {"column_min": 19, "row_min": 239, "column_max": 404, "row_max": 327}, "text_content": "And God saw the light , that it was good : and God\ndivided the light from the darkness .\nAnd God called the light Day , and the darkness he\ncalled Night . And the evening and the morning were", "children": [7, 8]}, {"id": 26, "class": "Text", "height": 35, "width": 398, "position": {"column_min": 19, "row_min": 361, "column_max": 417, "row_max": 396}, "text_content": "And God said , Let there be a firmament in the midst\nof the waters , and let it divide the waters from the", "children": [9]}, {"id": 27, "class": "Text", "height": 14, "width": 56, "position": {"column_min": 19, "row_min": 403, "column_max": 75, "row_max": 417}, "text_content": "waters ."}, {"id": 28, "class": "Text", "height": 14, "width": 350, "position": {"column_min": 32, "row_min": 502, "column_max": 382, "row_max": 516}, "text_content": "And God called the firmament Heaven . And the"}, {"id": 29, "class": "Text", "height": 17, "width": 347, "position": {"column_min": 19, "row_min": 524, "column_max": 366, "row_max": 541}, "text_content": "evening and the morning were the second day ."}, {"id": 30, "class": "Text", "height": 55, "width": 396, "position": {"column_min": 18, "row_min": 432, "column_max": 414, "row_max": 487}, "text_content": "And God made the firmament , and divided the wa\nters which were under the firmament from the waters\nwhich were above the firmament : and it was so .", "children": [10]}, {"id": 31, "class": "Text", "height": 109, "width": 395, "position": {"column_min": 18, "row_min": 553, "column_max": 413, "row_max": 662}, "text_content": "And God said , Let the waters under the heaven be\ngathered together unto one place , and let the dry land\nappear : and it was so .\n10 And God called the dry land Earth and the\ngathering together of the waters called he Seas : and", "children": [12]}, {"id": 32, "class": "Text", "height": 17, "width": 184, "position": {"column_min": 17, "row_min": 679, "column_max": 201, "row_max": 696}, "text_content": "The Book of Mormon"}], "img_shape": [768, 432, 3]}